a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凝祥三首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"已随芳草藉杯盘，更任垂杨拂马鞍。\n斜日两竿眠犊晚，春波一眼去凫寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51469,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"凝祥三首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"斋祠太一馆清真，望秩名山固有神。\n斜日苑门人不到，灵风自扫石床尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51470,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"橘","author":"张耒","text":"霭霭高林绿实圆，清霜一洗若金悬。\n李衡何等相奴隶，自有高人相国贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51471,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赞皇公","author":"张耒","text":"才高一世有奇功，掩卷令人独想风。\n莫笑狄祠迁武相，致人从古是英雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51472,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠无咎","author":"张耒","text":"欺马街泥未肯乾，重城含雾晓漫漫。\n谁令万屋淋漓雪，犹作长安半夜寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51473,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠别仪上人","author":"张耒","text":"师似浮云触处闲，倦飞知我未能还。\n林泉会有相逢日，风月应须乞半山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51474,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠赵簿景平二首 其二","author":"张耒","text":"纷纷俗物久堪憎，爱子萧萧眉宇清。\n莫叹青衫掩事业，白头卿相死无名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51475,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠赵簿景平二首 其一","author":"张耒","text":"明道新坟草已春，遗风犹得见门人。\n定知鲁国衣冠异，尽戴林宗折角巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51476,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠圆明老","author":"张耒","text":"一粥一斋年已老，千经万论不留心。\n菩提本自非言说，默默知师得更深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51477,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠铁牌道者","author":"张耒","text":"微官待旦亦朝天，赖尔绝胜钟鼓传。\n举世昏冥竟难警，怜君常负五更眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51478,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蹇驴","author":"张耒","text":"骥伏盐车饥不行，疲牛与尔饱平生。\n子荆自是佳公子，亦向人前作汝声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51479,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鵁鶄","author":"张耒","text":"败荷枯苇一方池，溪上鵁鶄坐得知。\n何事月寒风露下，挛拳孤影在风枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51480,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"一日复一日","author":"张耒","text":"一日复一日，炎凉行一周。\n异乡犹在望，白发久生头。\n且看寻橦技，休怀失马忧。\n天公有至信，万古一春秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51481,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丁丑岁与德载相别辛巳复会于颍相视而叹仍蒙先惠佳句谨次韵","author":"张耒","text":"重入修门一见春，衰容仍是卧漳滨。\n归来未解累囚服，挥去真同下坂轮。\n痛饮久无连夜醉，白头何啻二毛新。\n□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51482,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月七日晚步园中见落叶如积感而作","author":"张耒","text":"东园久不到，落叶曲池平。\n摇落遽如许，岁时真可惊。\n衡茅望故里，渔钓寄馀生。\n放逐逢艰岁，藜羹未敢轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51483,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月十五日希古生日以诗为寿","author":"张耒","text":"苍颜白发老祠官，邂逅淮扬一笑欢。\n且可鲸吞卮满酒，行看鹗立豸拿冠。\n寿觞满对秋风举，生日欣逢伏暑阑。\n阅世祝公松柏寿，从来霜雪不能寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":51484,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]